flowchart TB
    Client[Web Browser / QGIS / External Client] --> Frontend[React SPA / Frontend UI]
    Frontend --> Nginx[NGINX Reverse Proxy]
    Client -. Direct API / Tus .-> Nginx

    Nginx --> FastAPI[FastAPI Backend Application]
    
    subgraph FastAPI Core & Middleware
        FastAPI --> AuthMiddleware[CORS & Auth Cookie Inspection]
        FastAPI --> DI[FastAPI Dependency Injection: get_db, get_current_user]
    end

    DI --> Endpoints[API Route Endpoints: projects, flights, data_products, tusd]
    Endpoints --> Repositories[CRUD Generic Repositories: CRUDBase, CRUDDataProduct]
    
    Repositories --> DB[(PostgreSQL + PostGIS Database)]
    
    Endpoints --> TaskQueue[Celery Task Dispatcher: Redis/RabbitMQ]
    TaskQueue --> Workers[Celery Background Workers]
    
    Workers --> GeoEngines[GDAL / Rasterio / PDAL Processing]
    Workers --> RPC[RPC Client: External Photogrammetry Metashape / ODM]
    
    Endpoints --> StaticProxy[ProtectedStaticFiles: Authorization Proxy]
    StaticProxy --> Storage[(File Storage / MinIO S3: GeoTIFFs, COPC.LAZ)]
